# dev_server_cert.pem is committed on purpose: it is the PUBLIC self-signed dev
# certificate (a copy of certs/server.pem — the private key lives in
# certs/server-key.pem, which stays gitignored). Committing it keeps debug builds
# linkable on a clean checkout; scripts/run-android-emulator.sh refreshes it from
# certs/server.pem when that file exists.
